  "description": "Jeong Tae-ju threw himself into the workforce to support his grandmother who was living alone, without even having had the chance to graduate properly. Working tirelessly at everything from food deliveries to odd jobs, Tae-ju found himself caught up in a false theft accusation, leaving him with a massive debt to loan sharks. Under the threats and coercion of the owner of the errand service, Tae-ju was forced to work at ‘Maehwa’, a high-end host bar.\n\n*“Tae-ju, be careful.”*\n\nOne day, as Tae-ju was about to serve a table in the VVIP room, the head chef issued him a warning. Entering the VVIP room with a sense of unease, he found a blood-soaked man, gangsters, and the VVIP Gye Beom-ho already seated. Beom-ho, who had been sizing Tae-ju up, gave him a substantial tip for a simple serving,\n\n*“If I keep receiving tips like this, I can get out of here within a year…!”*\n\nBrushing off the head chef’s warning, Tae-ju sees hope in Beom-ho’s tips... Will Tae-ju manage to pay off his debts and escape ‘Maehwa’ unscathed? Or...\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2336012351), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000098357), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=922031966)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/cigarettea), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000159863)\n\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/dambaejae)",
